            "sourceIds": [
              "forecasts-3d7b217355f2e6a34064",
              "forecasts-44c1216c3e37f45f4ff9"
            ],
            "text": "An exception from the transaction path, send wait, or database update is caught and logged as PUBLISH_RETRY followed by the exception class name. A later attempt depends on another invocation; this method contains no immediate retry loop."
