          "id": "claim-6b703722a55218fe6b9c",
          "sourceIds": [
            "forecasts-3d7b217355f2e6a34064"
          ],
          "text": "The source declares publishPending on a fixed-delay schedule with a 1,000 ms default; runtime activation remains unverified. Each invocation selects at most one unpublished outbox row by ID using FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, returning when none is available. For a selected row, it sends the stored payload to weather.forecast-updated with the place ID as key, waits up to ten seconds, then marks the row published in the database transaction. An exception is logged as PUBLISH_RETRY. Because broker send and database commit are separate effects, a crash can leave the row eligible for replay. The linked Dashboard consumer is an unassessed separate view, so delivery and downstream completion are not established."
        },
        "title": "Publish pending forecast updates"
      }
